WEBVTT

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:07.279
Class Ride, the screen the rider is on while pedalling, built as it was designed.

00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:15.160
The ride is at slash ride, and only the start button opens it, with the bike

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:20.441
connected. A bookmark or a reload opens The Class instead, and no ride starts for a

00:00:20.441 --> 00:00:22.204
bike that is not there.

00:00:25.809 --> 00:00:30.437
The header reads the class, the clock, Pause, Leave and Full screen. On a phone,

00:00:30.437 --> 00:00:31.605
only what fits.

00:00:36.133 --> 00:00:41.046
Under the video, the segment card counts the recovery down. Power reads On target

00:00:41.046 --> 00:00:46.020
within ten percent of the segment's target, and otherwise the difference in watts,

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:48.261
in words, never by colour alone.

00:00:51.618 --> 00:00:56.348
In a landscape window from seven hundred and sixty-eight pixels wide, nothing

00:00:56.348 --> 00:01:01.509
scrolls. Even on a phone on its side, the video takes the height left, above one row

00:01:01.509 --> 00:01:02.300
of four.

00:01:07.104 --> 00:01:12.143
In Ibiza, the course takes the video's box, behind the same header and bike panel.

00:01:17.428 --> 00:01:20.182
The same ride, from a phone to a desktop.

00:01:27.751 --> 00:01:32.535
The tests came first. Fourteen failed, as expected; twelve passed on the code

00:01:32.535 --> 00:01:37.505
carried over. Now three hundred and nine specs and one thousand four hundred and

00:01:37.505 --> 00:01:39.545
thirty-four unit tests pass.

00:01:43.237 --> 00:01:48.891
Telo Ride 1, from the Telo family, is the focused edition of Telo Ride: one class,

00:01:48.891 --> 00:01:50.087
nothing else.

00:01:50.433 --> 00:01:55.385
It pairs with a smart bike at home over Bluetooth, plays the class video, or draws

00:01:55.385 --> 00:02:00.397
the Ibiza Sunset Strip course to music if the rider chooses it, and sets the bike's

00:02:00.397 --> 00:02:03.898
resistance for every interval while the rider pedals.

00:02:04.243 --> 00:02:08.218
Connect the bike, take the class, see your number, and come back to beat it.
